WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.725
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:06.011
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.011 --> 00:00:09.511
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.511 --> 00:00:09.885
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:12.257
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.257 --> 00:00:15.897
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:19.292
Recall the parameter-change distinction, then reveal the first answer.

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:23.836
Rate the first distinction as Good and inspect the review counter.

00:00:23.836 --> 00:00:29.193
Reveal the second explanation after recalling it independently.

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:32.495
Rate this concept as Hard to distinguish it from remembered material.

00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:37.827
Reveal the context answer and compare it with the definition of training.

00:00:37.827 --> 00:00:41.131
Rate the third concept Again to keep it in the difficult set.

00:00:41.131 --> 00:00:46.376
Inspect the summary: one Again, one Hard, and one Good card.

00:00:46.376 --> 00:00:50.745
Start another review round without sending a new message.

00:00:50.745 --> 00:00:55.695
Reveal the first concept again in the new round.

00:00:55.695 --> 00:01:00.133
Re-rate the concept as Good after successful recall.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:06.641
Use Previous to revisit the earlier card.
